(A) QI-1 deficit identity  theta = w1 - Delta/(s2-s1)   [random measures]
    max |theta - (w1 - Delta/eps)| = 3.553e-15   over 500 random measures
    max (theta - w1)               = 0.000e+00   (bridge is sound: <= 0)
    identifiability at the degenerate point (s2 -> s1): two-point family nu_eps = w1 d_{s1} +
    (1-w1) d_{s1+eps} has theta = w1 EXACTLY for every eps, while (s1, s2, Ebar) -> (0,0,0)
    for every w1.  So at eps = 0 the triple carries NO information about w1: the 0/0 is real.
