    budget: theta >= w0  <=>  Delta <= (w1-w0)(s2-s1).  Flat cut: Delta = 0.7(Lambda-s2)/2,
    so w0=0.1 needs Lambda-s2 <= 2(0.2)(3)/0.7 = 1.71 = 0.57 eps ; w0=0.3 needs Lambda=s2 exactly.
    => the bridge needs the source's whole spectral weight above s2 to sit within O(eps) of s2.
