(H) summary
    [T] QI-1  theta = w1 - Delta/(s2-s1),  Delta = int_{[s2,inf)}(s-s2)dnu >= 0   (exact)
    [T] QI-2  uniform N-state band: theta = (3-N)/2  => N<=2 needed for any w0>0
    [T] QI-3  theta>1 (resp. theta<0) iff Ebar<s1 (resp. Ebar>s2): a built-in consistency flag
    [V] free field: eps=s2-s1 ~ 1/L^2 -> 0, w1 -> 0, theta -> -inf  (no positive certificate)
    [V] double well: theta = w1 - (5e-5..1.4e-3), certified at w0=0.1/0.3/0.5 (saturated)
    [V] synthetic YM-like: theta<0 for any cut wider than ~0.6 eps  (tail budget)
    [V] 4D bare read-only: Ebar_bare ~ 0 => theta>=0.98 (meaningless) or theta>1 (impossible)
    [NG] s2 from GEVP/Ritz/rho^2: upper-bound machines, wrong direction; theta over-claims
